      "summonRole": "Crystal Rabbit",
      "biography": "<p><em>Shoton Hijutsu (an Earthen Artifact).</em> It uses your highest jutsu attack bonus or Save DC when an effect calls for it. You command it as a Bonus action.</p><p><strong>Small Construct, unaligned.</strong> <strong>Armor Class</strong> 10 + 2 for every rank above D-Rank · <strong>Hit Points</strong> 10 + 10 for every rank above D-Rank · <strong>Speed</strong> 40 ft. STR +1 (save +3), DEX +4 (+7), CON +2 (+7), INT −5, WIS +0, CHA −5. <strong>Condition Immunities</strong> All Mental, All Sensory, Stunned, Petrified, Envenomed.</p><p><strong>Linked to you when summoned:</strong> AC, DR and hit points by the rank you cast the jutsu at, and your highest jutsu attack bonus and save DC.</p>"
